[2026-05-08T11:39:09.223Z] [STDOUT] ## Summary

Closes #27.

- Moves provider credential fields, archive imports, and direct probes into the Connections provider detail pages.
- Keeps data sections lightweight: their empty-state guides now show a compact CTA into Connections instead of repeating setup cards inline.
- Preserves `#conn-{provider}` deep links, now opening the matching provider detail inside Connections.
- Keeps Settings as an app-level page with a single Open Connections action.
- Adds the issue 27 case study with raw GitHub artifacts, online research, verification logs, and screenshots.

